### Login & Security - HTTP Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = ana.garcia@ods.cr
@password = password123

# ── 1. Autenticación ──

### Login de Usuario
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "ip": "127.0.0.1",
  "userAgent": "VS Code REST Client"
}

### Validar Token actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/validate
# Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Refrescar Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/refresh
# Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cerrar Sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/auth/logout
# Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

# ── 2. Gestión de Usuarios ──

### Obtener perfil de usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/2

### Obtener usuario por username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/username/gestor01

### Verificar disponibilidad de email
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/check-email/{{email}}

### Iniciar recuperación de contraseña
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/recovery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

# ── 3. Catálogos y Permisos ──

### Listar Roles del sistema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/roles

### Listar Sedes disponibles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/sedes

### Obtener permisos ODS del usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/2/permits

### Verificar permiso para ODS 01
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/2/permits/1

# ── 4. Administración y Auditoría ──

### Resumen general (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/admin/summary

### Usuarios activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/admin/active-users

### Historial de login
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/users/2/login-history?dias=30

### Estadísticas del sistema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/admin/statistics

# ── 5. Utilidades ──

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/login/health
